# Jellyfin.Server is rebuilt from this commit and its jellyfin.dll and
# Jellyfin.Server.Implementations.dll replace the base image's (see .github/workflows/build.yaml).
# The commit must be the base image's Jellyfin release plus fixes; the build checks that its
# version matches the FROM tag in the Dockerfile.
#
# dbc0c0942f: pgsql-12.4 = v12.4 plus
# - "Materialise ratings before updating them in MigrateRatingLevels", without which 12.4's
#   MigrateRatingLevels fails on PostgreSQL (jellyfin.dll).
# - "Break ordering ties by Id so paged item queries are stable" and its activity log and
#   trickplay follow-up, without which paging through items that tie on the sort keys can
#   repeat some and skip others (Jellyfin.Server.Implementations.dll).
# Remove this file and the patch steps once a Jellyfin release includes the fixes.
JELLYFIN_PATCH_REPO=evan314159/jellyfin
JELLYFIN_PATCH_REF=dbc0c0942f4ab8e25cd87c6a9218c942fab82fd7
